# GladNoAd — CDN

Generated distribution assets for GladNoAd devices. **This repository contains no
source code** — only build outputs that GladNoAd units fetch at runtime.

## Contents
- `bloom.bin` — the active blocklist, packed as a bloom filter. This is a one-way
  hash of domain names; the original domain list is **not** recoverable from it.
- `bloom_date.txt` — build timestamp the device checks to decide whether to update.

## Blocklist sources & attribution
The domains packed into `bloom.bin` are aggregated from third-party blocklists, which
remain the property of their respective authors and are used under their own terms:

- **StevenBlack/hosts** — https://github.com/StevenBlack/hosts — MIT License.
- **HaGeZi / dns-blocklists** — https://github.com/hagezi/dns-blocklists — used under
  that project's own license; see its LICENSE for terms.

`bloom.bin` is a derived, hashed representation of these lists. No ownership of the
underlying domain data is claimed here.

